                    "text": "The Equal Shot Act and FIND Act (H.R. 45) are critical steps to stop federal overreach targeting lawful industries. Under Biden\u2019s SBA, firearm businesses faced ideological exclusion from programs meant for all small enterprises\u2014pure viewpoint discrimination. These bills force agencies to follow neutral criteria, blocking bureaucrats from weaponizing grant processes against Second Amendment supporters.\n\nWhile the Equal Shot Act focuses on SBA fairness, FIND\u2019s contracting prohibitions prevent corporate collaborators from sidelining gun manufacturers through backdoor ESG policies.\n\nTogether, they dismantle the administrative state\u2019s ability to punish disfavored industries\u2014exactly how government should defend constitutional rights, not undermine them.",
